{"steam_appid":3531260,"steam_name":"Superhero Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531260/1640727685/f2d0d806b57a85f8f73b40614f56f3fd7c49f58a/1750858604/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749487147","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154308/e6cf7ba8957f4709c87ed0eab430a70762f3a9e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749487147","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/ss_78fe63bb73a9bda5169fb559c52f16aea4c52375.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784570055","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/51a7d031ad479d9810a7c20f8804dd48ea3bae7e/ss_51a7d031ad479d9810a7c20f8804dd48ea3bae7e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784570055","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/02dc7fd3b59a9b56da06cb5180f9a602e9c31c4a/ss_02dc7fd3b59a9b56da06cb5180f9a602e9c31c4a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784570055","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/ss_7e840b0998868be59f18d6b24c96044401599386.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784570055","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/ss_175382627bd86333b11534f5cc193506dabc3fd2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784570055"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a hero doesn’t pay the bills—so you’ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it’s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend—will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.poster.avif?t=1784570055\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.webm?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.mp4?t=1784570055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVidia GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["mightyraccoon! Studios"],"publishers":["mightyraccoon! Studios"],"release_date":"15 Sep, 2025"}